     "m": "同时继续调查"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "chunks": [
    {
     "t": "After the rollback, ",
     "m": "回滚之后"
    },
    {
     "t": "the error rate returned to normal ",
     "m": "错误率恢复正常"
    },
    {
     "t": "and payment processing recovered.",
     "m": "支付处理也恢复了"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "chunks": [
    {
     "t": "We then reviewed the code change ",
     "m": "然后我们复查代码变更"
    },
    {
     "t": "and prepared a safer fix ",
     "m": "并准备了更稳妥的修复"
